    {
      "id": "2070242115049947403",
      "text": "Automating my Indie iOS App development workflow has been long overdue but feels so good:\n\n- Tests and localization: Bolstering not only my unit test suite but UI tests as well, to support an automated localization screenshot flow orchestrated by GPT, and using @sketch mcp to pull that into the final assets\n\n- Marketing: Linking Astro and Apple Search Ads to pull a daily report of campaign performance globally, and adjust keywords and campaign settings \n\n- Releases: ASC CLI from @rudrank is a game changer on its own 🙏 Letting gpt use it to orchestrate new app releases with localization, App Store metadata, and more \n\n- Moar Skills: The new Xcode skills are a great addition, even to support iOS 26 development. Also tools like the foundation models cli!\n\nLooking forward to even more tools and capabilities to enhance the workflow 🤩",
